 "schema": "eldpc.results.heralded_loss.v1",
 "what": "Heralded final-measurement loss: the corrected herald insertion (record shift), its check at p_erase = 0, LER of the eldpc core and the ldpc reference on the six loss problems built with the corrected and with the uncorrected insertion, and the d = 3 herald-use comparison. Accuracy only; summary statistics and per-row aggregates; numbers as recorded.",
